10-0100 | M (555) 010-0101</span><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">100 Main Street, Anytown, ST 00000</span><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><a href=\"mailto:pat@yourcompany.com\">pat@yourcompany.com</a> | <a href=\"https://www.yourcompany.com/\">www.yourcompany.com</a></span><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<div>\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #E1E1E1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>From:</b> Ben Hart &lt;ben@hartridgefarms.example&gt; <br>\n<b>Sent:</b> Tuesday, November 10, 2026 11:46 AM<br>\n<b>To:</b> Lauren Pike &lt;lpike@pikemarshins.example&gt;<br>\n<b>Cc:</b> Pat Staffer &lt;pat@yourcompany.com&gt;<br>\n<b>Subject:</b> Loss payee - new equipment policy<o:p></o:p></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Lauren,<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Please add our lender as loss payee and additional insured on the new equipment policy. Their details are below. Pat is copied.<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks,<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Ben Hart<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Owner, Hart Ridge Farms LLC<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">4120 County Road 9, Fairview, KS 66425<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Cell (555) 010-0137<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"mailto:ben@hartridgefarms.example\">ben@hartridgefarms.example</a><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Loss payee / additional insured:<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Your Company<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Attn: Pat Staffer, Managing Director<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">100 Main Street, Anytown, ST 00000<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"Mso